; An amount on the line after its directive's header is never read as one:
; the header fails at its own line's end. So the 0 USD under the balance
; below does not count towards display precision: USD is written once
; without digits and once with one, and shows one.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "a tie between no digits and one"
  Assets:A   1 USD
  Assets:B  -1.4 USD

2020-01-03 balance Assets:A
  0 USD
